        {
            "id": "7415702",
            "objective": "Talk to Molli",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "741570201",
                    "speaker": "House-for-Sale Notice",
                    "text": "This house is for sale. Very reasonable price — purchase before it's too late!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "741570202",
                    "speaker": "Molli",
                    "text": "#{M#Mr.}{F#Ms.} {NICKNAME}, Ms. Paimon, it seems like Mr. Leroy doesn't live here anymore! Have you seen him?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "741570203",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "(Hey, do we want to tell the truth?)",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "741570204",
                            "text": "We ran into him.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "741570205",
                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                    "text": "So you did see him! Did you tell him the snacks were delicious?",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "741570206",
                                            "text": "We did.",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "741570207",
                                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                                    "text": "#I knew {M#Mr.}{F#Ms.} {NICKNAME} was trustworthy! You're the best. I brought some Bulle Fruit over — have some with me!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "741570214",
                                                    "speaker": "Black Screen",
                                                    "text": "Molli sighs, and waves goodbye, and just as she is about to leave..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "741570215",
                                                    "speaker": "Black Screen",
                                                    "text": "The door opens, and Autumn and Athos walk out."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "741570216",
                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                    "text": "So it was your voices we heard outside. Is there still something you want?",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "741570217",
                                                            "text": "We were just passing by.",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570218",
                                                                    "speaker": "Athos",
                                                                    "text": "Really? Small world. Autumn and I were just leaving."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570219",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "And Benoit?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570220",
                                                                    "speaker": "Athos",
                                                                    "text": "Oh, he's already gone somewhere else. A place that we'll only be going after a few more decades. I don't think you will be seeing him anytime soon."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570221",
                                                                    "speaker": "Athos",
                                                                    "text": "Though that's hard to say. Which will come first, tomorrow or an untimely end? Who knows?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570225",
                                                                    "speaker": "Athos",
                                                                    "text": "Ah, and isn't this the little rascal who's always looking for him?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570226",
                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                    "text": "..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570227",
                                                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                                                    "text": "Hi, Lady!"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570228",
                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                    "text": "...You look just like me. And you even have lavender eyes..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570229",
                                                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                                                    "text": "L—Lady, can I help you...?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570230",
                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                    "text": "How old are you?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570231",
                                                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                                                    "text": "I'm nine!"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570232",
                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                    "text": "What are your parents' names?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570233",
                                                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                                                    "text": "Uh... Are you okay, Lady?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570234",
                                                                    "speaker": "Athos",
                                                                    "text": "Your expression... Is something wrong with the kid? ... Wait, this can't be a coincidence, can it?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570235",
                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                    "text": "Are you adopted? Tell me."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570236",
                                                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                                                    "text": "#...{M#Mr.}{F#Ms.} {NICKNAME}, do you know this lady? What is she doing..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570237",
                                                                    "speaker": "Athos",
                                                                    "text": "Who asks questions like that? Allow me."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570238",
                                                                    "speaker": "Athos",
                                                                    "text": "Young miss, I remember you're very close with our Dad, right?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570239",
                                                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                                                    "text": "Yeah! Mr. Leroy treats me really well. Mr. Son-in-Law, does he not live here anymore?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570240",
                                                                    "speaker": "Athos",
                                                                    "text": "That's right, he's gone somewhere very far away and won't be coming back again."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570241",
                                                                    "speaker": "Athos",
                                                                    "text": "What does our Dad usually talk with you about? Can you tell me? When I go back, I can tell him how much you miss him."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570242",
                                                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                                                    "text": "Mr. Leroy always treats me to snacks, lets me pet Nana, and tells me my eyes are pretty!"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570243",
                                                                    "speaker": "Athos",
                                                                    "text": "Anything else?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570244",
                                                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                                                    "text": "He often tells me to say hi to my Mama and Papa for him, but they really don't like that..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570245",
                                                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                                                    "text": "Papa gets really angry and says that Mr. Leroy is a bad person, and that he's \"blackmailing\" them."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570246",
                                                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                                                    "text": "Though they've forbidden me from coming here, I made an agreement with Mr. Leroy, so I sneak over. Please don't tell Papa, Mister!"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570247",
                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                    "text": "That's just like him. He won't stop squeezing until he's wrung the last drop of value out."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570248",
                                                                    "speaker": "Athos",
                                                                    "text": "...That bastard. ...Sorry. We were talking about something else just now."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570249",
                                                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                                                    "text": "M—Mister, Lady, is there anything else? If not, then I—I'll just go home now."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570250",
                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                    "text": "...Do your mother and father love you?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570251",
                                                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                                                    "text": "They're the best parents in the whole wide world."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570252",
                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                    "text": "..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570253",
                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                    "text": "That's good, then."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570254",
                                                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                                                    "text": "I'm going home now! Bye, Lady! Bye, Mister!"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570255",
                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                    "text": "Goodbye.",
                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "741570256",
                                                                            "text": "Is this really okay?",
                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "741570258",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                                    "text": "I have imagined this scene time and time again... But nothing is better than knowing that she's happy. That's enough for me."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "741570259",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                                    "text": "I... I'm not my father. I don't want to cause trouble for her current family."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "741570260",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Athos",
                                                                                    "text": "I don't mean to be that guy, but didn't you buy a music box for her? Are you not going to give it to her now?"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "741570261",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                                    "text": "..."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "741570262",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                                    "text": "No, there's no need. She... doesn't look like she lacks for things like that."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "741570263",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                                    "text": "I'll think of ways to keep visiting her in the future. Whatever she needs, I'll find a way."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "741570264",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                                    "text": "...I'll give the music box to someone else. After all, I spent a lot of time and effort picking it out."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "741570265",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                                    "text": "Excuse me, little white-haired girl... Do you like gifts?"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "741570266",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                                    "text": "Do you mean Paimon? Wait, you want to give this to Paimon?"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "741570267",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                                    "text": "Yes, I do. It's a gift, so please, enjoy it. I hope it will still have some bit of value to you."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "741570268",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Autumn",
                                                                                    "text": "Sorry, Athos, but I think we'll need to stay in the Court of Fontaine a bit longer."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "741570269",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Athos",
                                                                                    "text": "Don't worry, it's all the same to me. Let's go."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "741570270",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Black Screen",
                                                                                    "text": "You watch the two of them walk away, leaving this street behind — thus does the story of the Leroy family draw to an end."
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "741570257",
                                                                            "text": "You don't plan on telling her?"
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "741570219",
                                                            "text": "And Benoit?"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "741570222",
                                                            "text": "How's Benoit?",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570223",
                                                                    "speaker": "Athos",
                                                                    "text": "This world is full of inequity, extreme poverty, and excessive greed. The punishment that the laws of Fontaine fail to mete out, we shall execute in their stead."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "741570224",
                                                                    "speaker": "Athos",
                                                                    "text": "I mean to say, he has gone to where he belongs."
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "741570208",
                                            "text": "We forgot.",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "741570209",
                                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                                    "text": "Oh, really? That's a pity. I guess I'll never get a chance to let Mr. Leroy know. As for the Bulle Fruit I brought over... I guess I should just give it to you."
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "741570210",
                            "text": "Haven't bumped into him.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "741570211",
                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                    "text": "Oh, that's a pity. I suppose I'll never get to see Mr. Leroy again, huh."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "741570212",
                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                    "text": "I brought some Bulle Fruit over, and was planning on giving them to him if I saw him... but since he doesn't live here anymore, why don't you take them?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "741570213",
                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                    "text": "But no matter what, I think I'll always remember Mr. Leroy! Bye bye!"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "7415703",
            "objective": "",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "741570301",
                    "speaker": "House-for-Sale Notice",
                    "text": "This house is for sale. Very reasonable price — purchase before it's too late!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "741570302",
                    "speaker": "Molli",
                    "text": "#{M#Mr.}{F#Ms.} {NICKNAME} and Ms. Paimon! Are you guys here to talk to Mr. Leroy?",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "741570303",
                            "text": "Is Benoit at home?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "741570304",
                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                    "text": "He isn't here. Father said Mr. Leroy will never live here again — he's gone to live underground."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "741570308",
                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                    "text": "In the Fleuve Cendre?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "741570309",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Is it the same Fleuve Cendre we went to before?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "741570310",
                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                    "text": "If so, then no, not that place. Father said he's gone much deeper underground."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "741570311",
                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                    "text": "The Steambird said that Mr. Leroy fell from a very high place while climbing a mountain, and went tumbling down."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "741570312",
                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                    "text": "Though to be honest, I don't really know how having a bad fall and moving are connected..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "741570313",
                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                    "text": "By the way, I saw Mr. Leroy's son-in-law! And there was a very nice lady too."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "741570314",
                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                    "text": "The lady really liked me, and she has the same eyes as I do! Our eyes are both lavender."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "741570315",
                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                    "text": "She even asked me where I lived, and said she'd come see me if she had time, and be my good friend! I guess everyone in the Leroy family is a good person!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "741570316",
                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                    "text": "*sigh* I even brought some Bulle Fruit over for Mr. Leroy, but since he isn't there..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "741570317",
                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                    "text": "Can I give it to you, instead?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "741570318",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Thank you, Molli!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "741570319",
                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                    "text": "Don't mention it! Mama and Papa always say we should be generous with our friends."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "741570320",
                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                    "text": "I did another good thing today! I'm going to go back and write it in my diary, yay!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "741570321",
                                    "speaker": "Black Screen",
                                    "text": "As you watch the happy Molli leave that street behind, the story of the Leroy family draws to an end."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "741570305",
                            "text": "We were just passing by.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "741570306",
                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                    "text": "I was just thinking if I should tell you that Mr. Leroy moved."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "741570307",
                                    "speaker": "Molli",
                                    "text": "Father said Mr. Leroy will never live here again, and that he's gone to live underground."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
